From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sigivb72-netizen <vergilx63@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:07:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] podot: servers, scene, modules: clear singletons and
 registries on teardown

Needed to set the engine up again in the same process (in-process
instances): singletons clear their pointer in their destructor, the
rendering server globals (RSG) are cleared after the renderer is
finalized, and registries filled at every setup (movie writers, scene
idle callbacks, navigation server managers) are reset or de-duplicated.
